{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"states\": [\n    {\n      \"shot\": 1,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他决定暂时不再猜测两个人的以后，先享受眼前的亲近。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"放松、轻盈、释然、想笑又想哭\",\n      \"missed\": \"再猜下去会让今天也过不踏实的原因，需要读第一行才能完整理解；下方身体失重、夏夜微风、银色蛛丝和飞瀑般音符的具体画面也不容易一眼抓全。右侧前几阶段的情绪经历基本需要逐条读。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 2,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他不再纠结未来，选择先珍惜此刻两个人靠近的感觉。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"松弛、安心、轻盈、释然、感动得想哭\",\n      \"missed\": \"肩膀松开、胸腔打开是情绪变化的身体表现，但容易被当成主句里的补充描述略过；下方音乐意象与眼泪释放之间的联系需要读完才能建立。右侧六个阶段的前后关系也不容易快速读清。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 3,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他暂时放下对未来的猜测，愿意安心享受眼前的亲近。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"放松、轻盈、释然、想笑、想哭\",\n      \"missed\": \"下方音符如银色蛛丝、声音如飞瀑落水，以及眼泪终于不用憋着的情绪落点，需要逐句阅读才能串起来。下半部音符动画较密，亮点也比较醒目，会稍微分走扫读注意力。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    }\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3,\n  \"link\": 3,\n  \"main_problem\": \"主句虽然用绿色突出“先好好享受眼前的亲近”和“有点想哭”，核心方向明确，但一整段仍塞进了停止猜测、享受亲近、身体放松、情绪释放几层意思，真正的处境和情绪关系需要读完整句才能完全理解。下方三行又是连续的音乐与身体意象，和上方人物处境之间缺少一眼可见的连接。整体不是散乱，而是主线能抓到，细节之间的关系还需要二次阅读。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "2a681344-0c3f-4e04-829f-d7566d3e908b", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261109T223743164250Z", "elapsed_seconds": 99.437, "completed_utc": "2026-11-09T22:39:22.605460+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "3f3eeffdf4c05b23fbb243f7fb30ecc8a4c9ba71380be3ec5484a2334a292fbe", "attachment_count": 3}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 3, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261109T223743164250Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "9ffb30ef3d547ae5b7f656320d7a420be3685405b0b3fc9391aeaed788e350ca"}}}
